          "level": 2,
          "content": "EXERCISE 8.2"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.124,
            0.179,
            0.365,
            0.196
          ],
          "content": "**1.** Evaluate the following :"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.204,
            0.851,
            0.283
          ],
          "content": "(i) sin $6 0 ^ { \\circ } \\cos 3 0 ^ { \\circ } + \\sin 3 0 ^ { \\circ } \\cos 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (ii) $2\\tan^{2}45^{\\circ}+\\cos^{2}30^{\\circ}-\\sin^{2}60^{\\circ}$ (iii) $\\frac{\\cos 45^{\\circ}}{\\sec 30^{\\circ}+\\csc 30^{\\circ}}$ (iv) $\\frac{\\sin 30^{\\circ}+\\tan 45^{\\circ}-\\csc 60^{\\circ}}{\\sec 30^{\\circ}+\\cos 60^{\\circ}+\\cot 45^{\\circ}}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.302,
            0.525,
            0.344
          ],
          "content": "(v) $\\frac{5\\cos^{2}60^{\\circ}+4\\sec^{2}30^{\\circ}-\\tan^{2}45^{\\circ}}{\\sin^{2}30^{\\circ}+\\cos^{2}30^{\\circ}}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.122,
            0.361,
            0.852,
            0.467
          ],
          "content": "**2.** Choose the correct option and justify your choice : (i) $\\frac{2\\tan 30^{\\circ}}{1 + \\tan^{2}30^{\\circ}}$ $\\left(  A  \\right) \\quad \\sin 60^{\\circ}$ (B) $\\cos 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ $\\tan 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (D) $\\sin 3 0 ^ { \\circ }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.165,
            0.476,
            0.807,
            0.547
          ],
          "content": "(ii) $\\frac{1 - \\tan^{2}\\ 45^{\\circ}}{1 + \\tan^{2}\\ 45^{\\circ}} =$ (A) $\\tan 9 0 ^ { \\circ }$ $\\sin 4 5 ^ { \\circ }$ (D) 0"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.162,
            0.555,
            0.821,
            0.599
          ],
          "content": "(iii) sin 2A = 2 sin A is true when A = (A) $0 ^ { \\circ }$ (B) $3 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (C) $4 5 ^ { \\circ }$ (D) $6 0 ^ { \\circ }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.161,
            0.616,
            0.344,
            0.655
          ],
          "content": "(iv) $\\frac{2\\tan 30^{\\circ}}{1 - \\tan^{2}30^{\\circ}}$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.202,
            0.665,
            0.85,
            0.685
          ],
          "content": "(A) $\\cos 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (B) $\\sin 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (C) $\\tan 6 0 ^ { \\circ }$ (D) $\\sin 3 0 ^ { \\circ }$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.704,
            0.849,
            0.745
          ],
          "content": "3. If $\\tan \\left( \\mathbf{A} + \\mathbf{B} \\right) = \\sqrt{3}$ and tan $( \\mathrm{A} - \\mathrm{B} ) = \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}} ; 0^{\\circ} < \\mathrm{A} + \\mathrm{B} \\leq 90^{\\circ} ; \\mathrm{A} > \\mathrm{B}$ , find A and B."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.123,
            0.761,
            0.721,
            0.778
          ],
          "content": "**4.** State whether the following are true or false. Justify your answer."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.17,
            0.785,
            0.439,
            0.801
          ],
          "content": "(i) sin $(A + B) = \\sin A + \\sin B.$"
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.807,
            0.585,
            0.825
          ],
          "content": "(ii) The value of sin θ increases as θ increases."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.831,
            0.59,
            0.848
          ],
          "content": "(iii) The value of cos   increases as   increases."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.16,
            0.854,
            0.479,
            0.871
          ],
          "content": "(iv) sin θ = cos θ for all values of θ."
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "bbox": [
            0.164,
            0.878,
            0.469,
            0.895
          ],
          "content": "(v) cot A is not defined for $\\mathrm { A   =   0 ^ { \\circ } }$"
